-- Name: COLUMN assessment_problem.problem_scope; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.assessment_problem.problem_scope IS '문제 콘텐츠의 공유·귀속 범위를 나타낸다.';


