COMMENT ON COLUMN public.commit_attribution.is_revert_commit IS '되돌리기 커밋 여부 값을 저장한다.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN commit_attribution.is_bot_commit; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.commit_attribution.is_bot_commit IS '봇 커밋 여부 값을 저장한다.';


