--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.project_verification_concept.org_id IS '검증 개념의 기관 경계이다.';


--
-- Name: COLUMN project_verification_concept.teaches_id; Type: COMMENT; Schema: public; Owner: -
--

COMMENT ON COLUMN public.project_verification_concept.teaches_id IS '공통 개념 원장을 참조한다.';


